%% HANDWRITTEN. Checked against D45 (revised)
flowchart TB
    END["<b>the customer hangs up</b><br/>media gone. No channel, no resource held."]:::in
    END --> ACW["<b>AFTER_CALL_WORK starts HERE</b><br/>the clock runs from DISCONNECT, not from<br/>any form action. No new call is offered."]:::acw

    ACW --> BOTH["<b>two independent things to do,<br/>in whatever order suits the agent</b>"]:::split

    BOTH --> A1["<b>A. our record</b><br/>edit the AI-drafted summary,<br/>pick a disposition, add follow-ups"]:::step
    BOTH --> B1["<b>B. everything else</b><br/>another internal tool, a paper form,<br/>a colleague to ask, a note to write"]:::other

    A1 --> SAVE["<b>SAVE</b> - only ever pressed by a human"]:::save
    SAVE --> REC[("call record closed.<br/>Our system's work is finished -<br/>which is NOT the same as the agent being free.")]:::store

    B1 --> DECL
    REC --> DECL
    DECL{"<b>the agent declares what they do next</b><br/>THIS is what ends ACW"}:::gate

    DECL -- "Ready" --> R1["ACW ends · <b>offerable</b>"]:::ok
    DECL -- "Last call" --> R2["ACW ends · offerable, then stops"]:::ok
    DECL -- "Break / Lunch" --> R3["ACW ends · <b>not offerable</b>"]:::neutral
    DECL -- "Training / Admin" --> R4["ACW ends · <b>not offerable</b>"]:::neutral

    NOAUTO["<b>there is NO auto-save.</b> An earlier draft of this<br/>decision had a timer save the record 'so a call cannot<br/>hang open'. That was wrong three times over:<br/>it contradicted 'pre-filled, never auto-saved'; nothing<br/>is actually held open once the customer hangs up; and<br/>an unsaved wrap-up is HONEST data - it records that<br/>this call was never wrapped up."]:::warn

    ANY["<b>why ANY state ends ACW, not just Ready.</b><br/>An agent who saves the record and goes to lunch has<br/>finished their after-call work - they are simply not<br/>available. Ending ACW only on Ready would show them<br/>in after-call work for an hour."]:::note

    AXES["<b>the two axes do all the work here.</b><br/>system_state: AFTER_CALL_WORK -> AVAILABLE (the platform<br/>has no work for you). agent_intent: whatever they chose.<br/>Offerable is still AVAILABLE AND intent in (ready, last_call).<br/>Lunch ends ACW and stays un-offerable, with no new state."]:::note

    TIMER["<b>any timer is a VISIBILITY device only.</b><br/>After a threshold it raises a long-ACW indicator for<br/>the agent and their supervisor. It writes nothing<br/>and changes no state. It must never auto-ready."]:::note

    ONE["<b>still one click in the common case:</b><br/><b>Save &amp; Ready</b> together. They separate only<br/>when the agent needs them to."]:::ok

